    "updated_at": "2026-11-22T15:37:53Z",
    "body": "Coordinator: the blocker of this issue changed. #3324 is closed by PR #3378 (merge commit 893e749c0). That PR gives the shared read view of the picks (`PathPicks`, the per-kind answer of `KindInfo::pick()`, and one refusal text for a kind that does not take a pick). It does not change where a pick is stored: only 2D Contour and Wire Contour have a field for one.\n\nThe storage for the other kinds, one operation-level key with its command and MCP field, is #3339. This issue keeps the label `blocked` and now depends on #3339. The person who closes #3339 removes `blocked` from the family issues #3325 to #3334.\n",
    "author_association": "OWNER",
