    "body": "fix on issue/3334-plasma-start-exit · PR #3986 · pinned by `start_exit_shared` (`plasma::the_pierce_is_at_the_start_pick_and_the_torch_goes_off_at_the_exit_pick`, `plasma::a_pick_whose_pierce_falls_on_the_part_is_refused_by_name`, `plasma::undo_and_redo_restore_the_picks_and_the_path`), `mcp_plasma` (`plasma_mcp_edit_operation_sets_the_start_and_exit_picks`), `camcraft-motion` `plasma::picks_tests` · merges when reviewed\n\nNotes:\n\n- The waterjet kind is on `main` now. This PR does not change it. Its slice is #3983.\n- An exit pick with control compensation (G41/G42) is refused by name. The decision record in the PR gives the reason.\n- The light lane did not complete on the shared machine. The PR body says so. The review must run it.\n",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
